overed alternatives without reservations.","id":"issuer-lyon-geneva-ter-lex","publisher":"Interrail/Eurail","publisher_updated_at":"2026-09-08","url":"https://help.interrail.com/hc/en-001/articles/9109345417245-How-to-go-from-Paris-to-Lyon-and-Geneva-avoiding-busy-high-speed-trains"},{"evidence_summary":"The issuer's 2026 Swiss validity map shows the Geneva regional corridors to Annemasse, Coppet, the airport and La Plaine as included.","id":"issuer-swiss-validity-2026","publisher":"Interrail/Eurail","url":"https://www.interrail.com/content/dam/_new-structure/doc/res/sbb_validity_map_2026.pdf"},{"evidence_summary":"The 2026 operator map identifies L4 Coppet-Annemasse, L7 Geneva Airport/Vernier-Annemasse, and Geneva-Bellegarde regional trains towards Lyon, Grenoble and Valence.","id":"sbb-geneva-network-2026","publisher":"SBB","url":"https://www.sbb.ch/content/dam/internet/sbb/downloads/multi/reiseinformationen/bahnverkehrsinformation/pdf-fahrplaene/abfahrtsplakate/2026/liniennetzplaene/LPL_Gen%C3%A8ve.pdf.sbbdownload.pdf"},{"evidence_summary":"The operator identifies RE33 Annemasse-Geneva-Martigny-St-Maurice. The issuer's 2026 validity map includes the Annemasse-Geneva corridor.","id":"sbb-re33-network-2026","publisher":"SBB","url":"https://network.sbb.ch/en/line/RE33"},{"evidence_summary":"The issuer includes Zurich S-Bahn except S4, S10 and S18. This extension is restricted to the independently identified SBB S9 corridor.","id":"issuer-zurich-sbahn","publisher":"Interrail/Eurail","url":"https://www.interrail.com/en/plan-your-trip/tips-and-tricks/trains-europe/trains-country/trains-switzerland"},{"evidence_summary":"The municipality identifies S9 Schaffhausen-Uster via Jestetten, Lottstetten, Rafz and Zurich.","id":"jestetten-s9-route","publisher":"Municipality of Jestetten","url":"https://www.jestetten.de/gemeinde-jestetten/lage-anfahrt-1"},{"evidence_summary":"CFL identifies its cross-border Coradia service to Arlon and SNCB responsibility on the Belgian section.